    challenging: "One of you is the other's type so completely that it's almost irritating. The attraction comes with projection: one of you sees in the other the pride and confidence they won't claim for themselves, then resents it. You two fight over who's more selfish while both desperate to be chosen. The upside: this mirror shows you what you're hiding. The trap is making your partner carry the ego you disown. The move: name one thing you admire about them, then go do it yourself.",
