    challenging: "One of you gives too much and the other starts expecting it. Overspending, overeating, over-promising: it feels good tonight and costs a lot later. The generous one quietly keeps a tally; the other thinks love means never hearing no. The trap: using gifts and splurges as proof of love. The move: once a month, plan a date that costs nothing, where the only gift is full attention and phones stay in a drawer.",
